## Usage

{% if project_type == 'python' -%}
```bash
uv sync
```

```bash
uv run {{ repo_name }} --help
```
{%- elif project_type == 'bash' -%}
```bash
scripts/main.sh
```
{%- elif project_type == 'ansible' -%}
Add hosts to `inventory/hosts.yml`, then:

```bash
ansible-galaxy collection install -r requirements.yml
```

```bash
ansible-playbook playbooks/site.yml --check --diff
```

```bash
ansible-playbook playbooks/site.yml
```

Secrets go in a vault file, e.g. `ansible-vault create inventory/group_vars/all/vault.yml`
(turn `all.yml` into `all/vars.yml` first).
{%- elif project_type == 'docker' -%}
```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

```bash
docker compose up --build
```
{%- elif project_type == 'terraform' -%}
```bash
cp environments/dev/terraform.tfvars.example environments/dev/terraform.tfvars
```

```bash
terraform init
```

```bash
terraform plan -var-file=environments/dev/terraform.tfvars
```
