## Development

The gate is `scripts/check.sh`: run it before every handoff or merge. CI runs
`scripts/check.sh --strict`, where a check whose tool is missing fails instead of
being skipped. Instructions for coding agents are in [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md).

Scaffolded from [devops-templates](https://github.com/djfiend/devops-templates)
(`project` and `contract` templates). To take a newer template release, run
`devops-update` with a clean tree, or `copier update --answers-file <file>` for each
`.copier-answers.*.yml`.
